eln (1.5.8+ds-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  The UbuntuOrigWeight fonts that upstream bundles into NotedELN are
  licensed under the Ubuntu Font Licence, which is not DFSG-free, so
  they have been removed from the Debian package.

  Notebooks now use the system "Ubuntu" font if it is installed (it is
  available in the non-free package fonts-ubuntu), and otherwise fall
  back to Noto Sans. Notebook pages may therefore look slightly
  different from how they appear with the upstream build, and text may
  flow differently. Notebook contents are unaffected.

 -- Barak A. Pearlmutter <bap@debian.org>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:33:53 +0000
